# M3.5: the short hop and the full hop are DIFFERENT HEIGHTS.
#
# Both jumps are KNEEBEND then JUMP_F, so expect_state cannot tell them apart --
# which is exactly how M3 shipped a build where every jump was a full hop and
# every state assertion still passed. This script does both jumps in one run and
# asserts the numbers.
#
# The expected values are DERIVED from the ported constants, not fitted to the
# output. ftCommonJumpGetJumpForceButton with a neutral stick has vel_x = 0, so
# sq = sqrt(1 - 0) = 1 and vel_y = force + min:
#
#   short  9.0 * 1 + 36.0 =  45.0                    (SHORT_FORCE, SHORT_MIN)
#   full  17.0 * 1 + 63.0 =  80.0 -> 77.0            (clamped, BTN_HEIGHT_CLAMP)
#
# then ftCommonJumpSetStatus adds A_JUMP_HEIGHT_BASE 24.0.  The SMW adaptation
# applies sqrt(1/2) to this primary grounded launch, so unchanged gravity yields
# approximately half the former apex; proc_physics applies A_GRAVITY 3.4 on the
# same tick.  The velocity visible on the takeoff frame is:
#
#   short  (45.0 + 24.0) * sqrt(1/2) - 3.4 = 45.390
#   full   (77.0 + 24.0) * sqrt(1/2) - 3.4 = 68.018
#
# Peak height is the sum of the rising frames, sum(V - 3.4k) while positive:
#
#   short  about 326 units (26 px), versus 666 units before scaling
#   full   about 714 units (57 px), versus 1450 units before scaling
#
# A neutral full hop is higher than the ~1070-unit hop seen in host_launch.script
# because that one holds the stick at 80, which drives sq to 0 and drops the
# force term entirely. That is the source game's behaviour, not a discrepancy.

neutral
frames 5
expect_state WAIT

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- short hop --
# Release the button inside C_KNEEBEND_SHORTHOP_FRAMES (3) so
# ftCommonKneeBendProcUpdate flags the short hop before the squat ends.
reset_peak
jump down
note short-hop-pressed
frames 1
expect_state KNEEBEND

jump up
note released-inside-shorthop-window
frames 3
expect_state KNEEBEND

frames 1
expect_state JUMP_F
expect_vel_air_y 45.3 45.5

frames 40
expect_peak_y 320.0 332.0

frames 60
expect_state WAIT

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- full hop --
# Same squat, button held all the way through, so the short-hop flag never sets.
reset_peak
jump down
note full-hop-pressed-and-held
frames 1
expect_state KNEEBEND

frames 3
expect_state KNEEBEND

frames 1
expect_state JUMP_F
expect_vel_air_y 67.9 68.1

frames 60
expect_peak_y 705.0 724.0
